# ── Movies by invokeil — local Worker dev secrets template ──────────────
# Copy to `worker/.dev.vars` for `wrangler dev` (NEVER commit .dev.vars).
# In production, provision these with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.

# TMDB v4 Read Access Token (recommended — Bearer auth)
TMDB_API_TOKEN=""

# Optional: TMDB v3 api_key fallback used only when no token is set
TMDB_DEMO_KEY=""

# OMDb API key (https://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx)
OMDB_API_KEY=""

# Google AI Studio key (Gemini tier of the AI chain)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Groq console key (Groq tier of the AI chain)
GROQ_API_KEY=""

# CORS allow-origin for the API (default "*")
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN="https://movies.invokeil.cfd"
